{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17102065","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17102065","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1710206501:0":{"text":"西のエリアは人でごった返しており、異国から来た商人の姿もあった。","source_cn":"你们首先望向西区。这里人头攒动，甚至还有异国的商人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE963E961165704C9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"西のエリアは人でごった返しており、異国から来た商人の姿もあった。","female":"西のエリアは人でごった返しており、異国から来た商人の姿もあった。","variant_male_record_index":"226254","variant_female_record_index":"226255","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1710206502:1":{"text":"呼び込みの声があちこちで響き合っている。香辛料や鉄の匂い、他にも何かの魔法薬らしき不思議な香りが漂っていた。","source_cn":"商贩的吆喝声此起彼伏。空气中混杂着香料、铁器和某种魔法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AE0B63839174D90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710206503:0":{"text":"西には商業市場があります。祭典の間は、王都の特別許可で、各国の商人がここで交易できるようになっているんです。","source_cn":"那边是西区的商业集市。庆典期间，王都特许各国的商人在这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29F42BE8B104B2E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710206504:0":{"text":"そういえば、国境から来た商人が、珍しい魔法素材をこっそり持ち込んだと聞きました。","source_cn":"我听说，还有来自边境的商人，偷偷带了些稀有的魔法材料。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C60490795A6CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710206505:0":{"text":"ゆっくり見て回りたいのですが、今はお仕事中ですから……","source_cn":"要不是今天有任务在身，我真想花时间去看一看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64